# SKILL.md frontmatter

Canonical schema: `core/schemas/skill-frontmatter.json`. Authoring rules: `rules/dev/skill-quality-standards.md`.

Frontmatter is validated against the portable schema by `scripts/validate-skill-frontmatter.py`; platform-specific fields are extensions of that schema, validated when present rather than required everywhere. Do not copy a field list into this file — it drifts. Read the schema.

```bash
python3 scripts/validate-skill-frontmatter.py path/to/SKILL.md
make validate
```

Use the bundled `skill-creator` skill — never hand-write a SKILL.md.
